diff -crN gdb-3.5.orig/README-jkp dist-gdb/README-jkp
*** gdb-3.5.orig/README-jkp
--- dist-gdb/README-jkp	Sat Mar  2 04:40:26 1991
***************
*** 0 ****
--- 1,14 ----
+ Installation:
+ 
+ - link a.out.gnu.h to a.out.h
+ - link stab.gnu.h to stab.h
+ - compile regex.c and dbxread.c without -O, otherwise
+   the assembler (gas 1.38.1) crashes
+ 
+ Bugs needing fixing:
+ 
+ - note that this port of gcc always prints floating point
+   numbers as doubles - support for single floats should be added.
+ - calling functions in inferior works, but messes up the stack
+ - INVALID_FLOAT macro expands to 0, in other words you probably
+   get FP exception if you try to print an invalid FP number
